    <string name="help_intro">Zazzage bidiyo na jama\'a kawai, waɗanda ba DRM ba waɗanda kuke da izinin adanawa.</string>
    <string name="help_step_url_title">1. Nemo ta adireshin yanar gizo</string>
    <string name="help_step_url_description">Manna adireshin shafin bidiyo a Gida, nemo bidiyo, kuma zaɓi abin da za a adana.</string>
    <string name="help_step_share_title">2. Raba daga Chrome ko X</string>
    <string name="help_step_share_description">Zaɓi Dambom a cikin wani menu na rabon app, tabbatar da hanyar haɗin yanar gizo, sannan fara nemo bidiyoyi.</string>
    <string name="help_step_web_title">3. Shiga cikin app</string>
    <string name="help_step_web_description">Bude shafukan yanar gizo da yawa, kunna bidiyo akan shafin na yanzu, sannan danna Gane bidiyo.</string>
    <string name="help_step_download_title">4. Sarrafa zazzagewa</string>
    <string name="help_step_download_description">Duba ci gaban layin kuma a dakata, ci gaba, soke, ko sake gwada kowace zazzagewa.</string>
    <string name="help_step_library_title">5. Kalli a Laburare</string>
    <string name="help_step_library_description">Lokacin da kuka tashi yayin da cikakken bidiyon gida ke kunna cikakken allo, ana ci gaba da sake kunnawa a PiP akan na\'urori masu tallafi. Bidiyon layi, dakatarwa, ko ɓacewar bidiyon ba sa shiga ta atomatik, kuma babu sabis na sake kunnawa baya.</string>
